  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Farklar: `[b - a for b, a in zip(before, after)]`.",
      "en": "The differences: `[b - a for b, a in zip(before, after)]`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`stats.ttest_1samp(diffs, 0)`.",
      "en": "`stats.ttest_1samp(diffs, 0)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nfrom scipy import stats\n\n\ndef paired_p(before, after):\n    diffs = [b - a for b, a in zip(before, after)]\n    return round(float(stats.ttest_1samp(diffs, 0).pvalue), 4)\n\n\nprint(paired_p([910, 860, 845, 930, 880], [890, 851, 820, 915, 866]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nfrom scipy import stats\n\n\ndef paired_p(before, after):\n    diffs = [b - a for b, a in zip(before, after)]\n    return round(float(stats.ttest_1samp(diffs, 0).pvalue), 4)\n\n\nprint(paired_p([910, 860, 845, 930, 880], [890, 851, 820, 915, 866]))\n```"
    }
  ],
